CFLAG:53:眠姦口上有 = 1
;Enable time stop rape dialogue
CFLAG:53:時間停止口上有 = 1
;Enable custom dialogue if playing as an existing character (Yuugi, etc.)?
CFLAG:53:なりきり口上有 = 1
;If 1, the character will object to you trying to take their virginity?
;破瓜キャンセル口上有に1を入れると、@M_KOJO_EVENT_K53_LOST_VIRGIN_STOPでキャンセルの成否を操作できます
;CFLAG:X:破瓜キャンセル口上有 = 0
;口上内抱き寄せ判定_初回と口上内抱き寄せ判定_通常に1を入れると、M_KOJO_EVENT_K53_PERMISSIONで押し倒しの成否を操作できます
;If 1, you can use M_KOJO_EVENT_K53_PERMISSION to make it so pushing down for the first time always succeeds or always fails
CFLAG:53:口上内抱き寄せ判定_初回 = 1
;If 1, you can use M_KOJO_EVENT_K53_PERMISSION to make it so pushing down always succeeds or always fails
CFLAG:53:口上内抱き寄せ判定_通常 = 1
;If 1, you can use M_KOJO_EVENT_K53_PERMISSION to make it so taking a character's penile virginity always succeeds or always fails
